-- Status: UNVERIFIED
MODULE [adv_smuggled]
THEOREM [adv_smuggled]:
  GIVEN:
    - [hx]: $x$ is a real number
    - [hpos]: $x$ is positive
  CLAIM:
    $x^2 \geq 0$
PROOF OF [adv_smuggled]:
  [1] HAVE $x > 0$.
      BY [hpos].
  [2] SHOW $x^2 \geq 0$.
      BY [1], a positive number has a positive square.
  QED BY [2].
